    <h2>Personal data</h2>
    <p>The site only stores what your account and your journal need: username, first name, last name, date of birth, city, encrypted password and your stops. To block attacks, failed login attempts are recorded as an encrypted fingerprint (username and IP address), then erased once they have expired. This data is neither sold nor passed on. The site only uses one session cookie, which also remembers your language, with no advertising or tracking.<br>To find a city, the text you type is sent to the <a href="https://photon.komoot.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Photon</a> search service (komoot); nothing else is passed to it. City names come from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap</a>.<br>To delete your account, write via <a href="https://github.com/puremax-lab" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/puremax-lab</a>.</p>
